        "accession_number": "0001022079-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "HealthyQuest™ focuses on prevention, progression and reversal, through which we offer a HealthyQuest™ Employee Business Network and intervention programs designed to engage employees in managing their health, including access to medical expertise and support programs tailored to their individual needs, helping them to adopt healthier behaviors and access better care at lower costs.",
        "start_character": 89936,
        "end_character": 90320
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001022079-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001022079-26-000015-f90d529e9a0e7205",
        "accession_number": "0001022079-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, we acquired select clinical testing and dialysis-related water testing assets of Fresenius Medical Care's wholly-owned Spectra Laboratories, a leading provider of renal-specific laboratory testing services in the United States.",
        "start_character": 16847,
        "end_character": 17083
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001022079-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001022079-26-000015-f90d529e9a0e7205",
        "accession_number": "0001022079-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we aim to develop holistic solutions responsive to challenges that healthcare providers and patients face, by developing solutions of tests, information and services focused on specific clinical challenges.",
        "start_character": 33217,
        "end_character": 33436
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001022079-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001022079-26-000015-f90d529e9a0e7205",
        "accession_number": "0001022079-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our services primarily are provided under the Quest Diagnostics brand, but we also provide services under other brands, including AmeriPath,® Dermpath Diagnostics,® ExamOne,® and Quanum.®",
        "start_character": 37757,
        "end_character": 37944
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001022079-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001022079-26-000015-f90d529e9a0e7205",
        "accession_number": "0001022079-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Physicians determine which laboratory to recommend or use based on a variety of factors, but we believe that we provide the most attractive service offering in the industry, including a comprehensive test menu, innovative test offerings, a positive customer experience, deep medical and scientific expertise, high quality, leading access and distribution, and data-powered integrated information-technology solutions.",
        "start_character": 5131,
        "end_character": 5548
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001022079-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001022079-26-000015-f90d529e9a0e7205",
        "accession_number": "0001022079-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The value creation side of our business includes product and commercial marketing and is organized by clinical franchise and focuses on customer solutions for the marketplace, including new test development and diagnostic insights.",
        "start_character": 22903,
        "end_character": 23134
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001022079-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001022079-26-000015-f90d529e9a0e7205",
        "accession_number": "0001022079-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under some capitated programs, we may provide certain services on a negotiated fee-for-service basis.",
        "start_character": 77196,
        "end_character": 77297
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001022079-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001022079-26-000015-f90d529e9a0e7205",
        "accession_number": "0001022079-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also develop in vitro diagnostic tests for FDA submissions as companion diagnostics, laboratory developed testing services (“LDTs”) for complementary diagnostics, and offer an array of assets and services to support the development of diagnostic insights, including our robust data set and patient services network.",
        "start_character": 47104,
        "end_character": 47422
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001022079-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001022079-26-000015-f90d529e9a0e7205",
        "accession_number": "0001022079-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also maintain distinct sales and marketing organizations for our offerings in Diagnostic Solutions and our employer testing services.",
        "start_character": 94688,
        "end_character": 94824
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001022079-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001022079-26-000015-f90d529e9a0e7205",
        "accession_number": "0001022079-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer a number of development opportunities for our employees through a robust library of offerings in our Learning Management System, EMPower.",
        "start_character": 92326,
        "end_character": 92477
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001022079-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001022079-26-000015-f90d529e9a0e7205",
        "accession_number": "0001022079-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer data services solutions, leveraging our data, analytics and expertise, to help therapy developers understand markets and patient and disease journeys, and plan commercial activity.",
        "start_character": 75389,
        "end_character": 75583
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001022079-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001022079-26-000015-f90d529e9a0e7205",
